{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11301470","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11301470","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130147001:1":{"text":"상단에서 가장 많이 언급된 사람은 블랙하울의 오우거랑 군신 브루투스 님이에요.","source_cn":"商队谈论最多的就是黑嚎的奥格，还有战神布鲁特斯大人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2766397089AEBF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130147002:1":{"text":"소렌과 아르사의 이름을 언급하는 상인과 강자들도 꽤 있었어요.","source_cn":"可索恩和阿尔萨的名字，也被那些商人们和其他的强者一同提及。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D009DA5ECDC7EEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130147003:1":{"text":"“야수에 대한 공포를 극복하지 못한다면 영원히 훌륭한 사냥꾼은 될 수 없다.”","source_cn":"”如果你不能克服对野兽的恐惧，那你永远也成为不了一位好...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E9481E066997312","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130147004:1":{"text":"...아버지가 하신 말씀이에요. 강자는 강자를 두려워하지 않는다고 늘 말씀하셨죠.","source_cn":"——这是老爹说过的，他说强者从来不会畏惧强者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11B9D58FAFFFF760","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:小蛮血阿米库":{"text":"아미쿠","source":"小蛮血阿米库","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}